      "sourceTextSha256": "2647537a74b76943cb7a0ecf03941c8166954e6c1b26451126ecf06d81a02310",
      "text": "Day 5 · Pick-up from your hotel for a guided tour combining cave tubing and The Belize Zoo. Float along the river through the jungle and into beautiful underground caves, then visit The Belize Zoo to meet a variety of native wildlife. Lunch and park fees included.\n\nContinue to Belize City for the ferry to the picturesque island of San Pedro, on Ambergris Caye, and a taxi to your hotel. (Meals: B, L)\n\n3 nights at Sunbreeze Hotel, standard room, tax and breakfast",
